# The shell scripts, Python tools and Dockerfile run inside Linux containers from this checkout, so every text file keeps
# LF line endings on every machine, whatever core.autocrlf says. PowerShell and DevEco Studio read LF files as they are.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.hap binary
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
